20	/**
21	 * Hud — the persistent in-run overlay (spec §6.2). It is purely a VIEW: it never
22	 * reaches into the run loop, only SUBSCRIBES to the events GameScene emits on
23	 * `scene.events` and re-paints. Hearts (shape+fill), score, a level-progress bar
24	 * (dynamic fill drawn through the frame's transparent window), plus pause + mute
25	 * controls and a small armor tell. Resets on `run:start`, freezes on `run:end`,
26	 * and removes every listener on scene shutdown (no leaks across replays).
